WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.454
Every strategy falls.

2
00:00:01.454 --> 00:00:04.127
The question is how far.

3
00:00:04.427 --> 00:00:06.735
An account grows for four years.

4
00:00:06.735 --> 00:00:09.427
At each new high it is 0%

5
00:00:09.427 --> 00:00:11.331
below its high.

6
00:00:11.631 --> 00:00:12.785
Then it falls.

7
00:00:12.785 --> 00:00:15.477
The red area is how far below

8
00:00:15.477 --> 00:00:18.150
its last high it sits.

9
00:00:18.450 --> 00:00:19.988
It climbs back slowly.

10
00:00:19.988 --> 00:00:23.815
The deepest point is the max drawdown: 35%.

11
00:00:24.115 --> 00:00:26.808
To get back from a 35% fall,

12
00:00:26.808 --> 00:00:29.865
the account needs a 53% gain.

13
00:00:30.165 --> 00:00:35.392
Here that took three and a half years.
